  "coreRules": [
    "Every settlement receives local factions.",
    "Capital and city settlements receive an Underledger or hidden faction layer.",
    "Every province receives a Provincial Accord, Transit Compact, divine Covenant, and Black Ledger Cell.",
    "Faction standing moves in 250-point steps to match the alignment model.",
    "Quest dates display Earth-first and Belavadös-second."
  ],
